    {
      "index": 2,
      "words": 85,
      "text": "The light shall be gathered in to the fire, and the fire itself gathered in to the water, and the water gathered in to the wind, and the wind gathered to the air, and the air gathered to the answer, and the answer gathered to the summons. Also, the summons to the purified Mind, which is the intellectual. The intellectual to the Pillar of Glory, [the Pillar of Glory to the First Man, the Man to the Ambassador, the Ambassador to] the aeons of greatness.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 15.29,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
